//        i2c10 (BMC_I2C10) = gold finger I2C_3V3_4 (A45/A46) — BIOS GPIO
//        i2c5  (BMC_I2C5)  = gold finger I2C_3V3_5 (A47/A48) — sensors/muxes
//        i2c16 (BMC_I2C16) = BMC-to-AST1060 PFR I2C link
//  [x] Local DC-SCM devices on i2c15 (parts confirmed from pg 34, 36, 2026-03-05):
//        TEMP1/TEMP2 = LM73CIMK at 0x48/0x49 (confirmed, not TMP75)
//        FRU EE = ST M24C64-RMN6TP at 0x50 (8KB, pagesize 32B, confirmed)
//        RTC = Epson RX8130CE at 0x32 (confirmed, not RV8803)
//        PMIC = APW6016P1 at 0x12 (confirmed, address was wrong at 0x14)
//        SCM PLD @0x40 — Lattice LCMXO3D-9400HC-5BG256C (confirmed)
//  [x] DDR4: MT40A512M16TB-062E confirmed (1GB, 16-bit DDR4, not 512MB)
//  [x] FRU EEPROM location corrected: i2c15 (local), NOT i2c11 (gold finger)
//  [x] BIOS GPIO corrected: i2c10 (BMC_I2C10), NOT i2c4
//  [x] TMP435 address: 0x4D on i2c5 (carrier bus I2C_3V3_5)
//  [x] TMP75 addresses: 0x48, 0x49, 0x4A, 0x4B on i2c5 (carrier sensors)
//  [x] UCD90120A power sequencer: 0x34 on i2c5
//  [x] PCA9548#16 fan mux: 0x72 on i2c5, CH0-3=fan EEPROMs, CH4=board EEPROM
//  [x] PCA9548#15 PSU/VR mux: 0x71 on i2c5, CH0=PSU0, CH1=PSU1, CH3=VRs
//  [x] PSU PMBus address: 0x58 (both PSU0 and PSU1)
//  [x] SGPIO interface: SGPIOM1 (not SGPIOM0) — GPIOH0-H3 (A18,B18,C18,A17)
//  [x] SGPIOM2 AST2620 pins: GPIOA4-A7 (balls K26/L24/L23/K25) — confirmed pg 20
//  [x] PFR chip identified: Aspeed PROT_AST1060
//        BMC → AST1060 via i2c16 (primary) + i2c12/7/9/6/HVI3C3 (topology TBD)
//        AST1060 → carrier: SMBF1→I2C_3V3_2, SMBF2→I2C_3V3_1, SMBF3→I2C_3V3_3
//  [x] Host ↔ BMC interface: LPC from eSPI-to-LPC bridge (ESPI_HPMCTRL)
//        AMD CPU → eSPI → ESPI_HPMCTRL → LPC → AST2620 GPIOW
//  [x] NCSI: MAC4 (kernel &mac3), RGMII4 pins — confirmed from pg 23 (2026-03-05)
//  [x] GPIO ARCHITECTURE (all balls confirmed from pg 23 full PDF, 2026-03-05):
//        GPIOO (PWM0-7):  BMC→PLD outputs — AD26/AD22/AD23/AD24/AD25/AC22/AC24/AC23
//        GPIOP (THRU):    mixed — AB22/W24/AA23/AA24/W23/AB23/AB24/Y23
//        GPIOQ (TACH0-7): PLD→BMC inputs — AA25/AB25/Y24/AB26/Y26/AC26/Y25/AA26
//        GPIOR (TACH8-15):mixed — V25/U24/V24/V26/U25/T23/W26/U26
//        CORRECTIONS vs old DTS: GPIOO/GPIOQ banks were swapped; GPIOQ was
//        incorrectly mapped to I3C/SMBF filter pins; GPIOR ball assignments shifted.
//  [x] ADC fully resolved from full PDF (pg 23 + pg 32, 2026-03-05):
//        13 active channels (ADC0-12); ADC13/14 tied to GND; ADC15 unused.
//        VCC_12V_SENSE: R_top=20k, R_bottom=2.49k, scale=9.036 (was 27k/3.48k/8.759)
//        ADC8-12 balls corrected: AB16/AA17/AB17/AE16/AC16
//        (prior DTS had AB17/TBD/AE16/AC16/AA16 — all shifted by one)
//  [x] PLD LCMXO3D-9400HC confirmed; JTAG master from BMC (MTCK1/MTMS1/MTDI1/MTDO1)
//  [x] GPIOB0 (ball J26): hpm-bmc-stby-rdy — input from HPM FPGA
//
